              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "Because Domino\u2019s Pizza franchises are locally operated, coupon codes can vary by store location. However, several active community-verified and promotional discount codes are widely used across Ireland:\n\n### 1. Active Community Discount Codes\n* **`WXOHWFWI`** \u2013 **35% off** when you spend \u20ac30 or more. *(This is currently the most popular and highly successful active code across Ireland, with recent users confirming it works in Dublin, Cork, Wexford, Kerry, Mullingar, and Bray).*\n* **`SPRING26`** \u2013 Variable discount on orders (recently verified in Dublin/Tallaght, though success may vary by store).\n* **`RMSIE225`** \u2013 **25% off** when you spend \u20ac20 or more. \n* **`WINTER25`** \u2013 **25% off** pizzas. \n\n### 2. Student Discounts\nIf you are a student, you can easily get a unique high-value discount code:\n* **35% Off Student Discount** (when you spend \u20ac25 or \u20ac30+ depending on the platform). You can generate your unique single-use code by verifying your student status through **UNiDAYS** or **Student Beans**.\n\n### 3. Built-In Deals (No Code Required)\nIf the voucher codes above aren't working at your local store, you can usually select these directly from the **\"Deals\"** or **\"Offers\"** tab on the Domino's website or app:\n* **Two for Tuesdays:** Buy one pizza, get one free on Tuesdays (medium or large pizzas only).\n* **30% Off Pizza Legend:** Customize your own \"Pizza Legend\" online to automatically receive up to 30% off.\n* **Lunch Deals:** Small lunch pizzas starting from \u20ac6.65.\n* **Collection Specials:** Personal pizzas for as low as \u20ac6.50 when you choose to collect in-store rather than opt for delivery.\n\n***Tip:** Always make sure to enter your Eircode and select your local store on the Domino's website before applying a code, as the checkout system needs to know which branch is preparing your order to validate local franchise promotions.*",
